# .trivyignore — CVE suppressions for the kleido container image.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line.
# Always include a comment explaining why the CVE is suppressed and
# a review date so stale suppressions get cleaned up.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # suppressed: only affects feature X which we don't use; review 2025-01
